  "assumptions": [
    "Weather steps come from the ASOS at Palm Beach International (IEM id DJT, formerly PBI), about 22 km south of Juno Beach, not from Juno Beach itself.",
    "Each step summarizes the 15 minutes ending at its time, from ASOS 1-minute data: precipMmPerHour = mean 1-min precip (in) x 25.4 x 60; gustKmh = max 1-min gust (kt) x 1.852; tempC = last 1-min temperature (F) converted.",
    "thunderPct is not a forecast probability. It is 100 when a DJT METAR or 5-min HFMETAR in the step's 15 minutes reports TS or VCTS, or a Severe Thunderstorm Warning listing Palm Beach County is active; otherwise null (unknown, not zero).",
    "Alerts are county-based (UGC FLC099, Palm Beach County). No storm-based warning polygon contained the Juno Beach point; the area field gives each polygon's distance from the site.",
    "NCEI Storm Events times are EST (UTC-5) and were converted to EDT (UTC-4). Hail reports are 15 to 40 km south and southwest of the site.",
    "Missing 1-minute rows are skipped; a field is null only when its whole 15-minute block is missing."
  ]
